  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C. Line 2 oven trays with baking paper. Finely chop or crush 2 garlic cloves. Rinse and drain the cannellini beans. Halve or quarter the tomatoes, depending on their size. Put 3 wraps on the lined trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/140838/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_01-3c5e09c19014ea60abcdf05ac61091d4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make bean mash: Put the garlic, beans, 1½ tbs olive oil and 1 tsp dukkah in a bowl. Using a potato masher or fork, coarsely mash. Season with salt and pepper. Spread over the wraps, leaving a 1cm border.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/140839/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_02-2926580d9bbc8c56d65fa9aea6b809f9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pizzas: Top the pizzas with the tomato, then crumble over the feta. Put the trays in the oven and bake, swapping the trays halfway, for 8-10 mins until the bases are golden and crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/140840/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_03-a49ec27f5bf99ddf4ba0511d16af9859.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep spinach salad: Meanwhile, put 2 tsp olive oil and 1 tsp balsamic vinegar in a large bowl. Whisk to combine and season with salt and pepper. Add the spinach leaves and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/140841/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_04-bc759d4f4e2c78354fd94ba1a59b85a9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the pizzas among plates, top with the spinach salad, sprinkle with ½ tsp dukkah and enjoy.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/140842/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_05-5a7a1690f603c65ff6737795493d279d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Add pitted black olives before or after baking, or sprinkle over some torn basil leaves before serving.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/140843/photos/large/DNY_Recipe_Card_New_Illustration_HACK-4d24763fbe97269c0089cc30f420a7fa.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
